{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/app.bsky.feed.post/3mrutuhh7lk2i","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2","uri":"at://did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/app.bsky.feed.post/3mrutuhh7lk2i","cid":"bafyreiaowjkjw7kxqzh2tdwzzn6m4bkp2n3deuduoxdkkikavtmuvr6kzu","auteur_did":"did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/hconwaymouret.bsky.social/post/3mrutuhh7lk2i","date":"2026-07-30T16:20:55.102Z","type":"original","indexe":"2026-07-30T16:21:02.966Z","text":"Les incendies de Gironde et des Landes doivent devenir le point de départ d'une nouvelle ambition nationale pour nos territoires.\n\nParce que le pire hommage que nous pourrions rendre à ceux qui ont combattu les flammes serait d'oublier, demain, les leçons qu'elles nous ont enseignées.","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":null,"embed":{"images":[{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/bafkreigwwyoluvvxfqxn6nptlqqbmolmp7xgjnk4ux5z6wd6vifiu2k4lu","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/bafkreigwwyoluvvxfqxn6nptlqqbmolmp7xgjnk4ux5z6wd6vifiu2k4lu","alt":"","ar":{"height":1440,"width":1080}},{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/bafkreiepmg4ly3bi4fwu3tqtc5ab5xv6ws7uogc4wcq4wonmedjz5lscza","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/bafkreiepmg4ly3bi4fwu3tqtc5ab5xv6ws7uogc4wcq4wonmedjz5lscza","alt":"","ar":{"height":1440,"width":1080}},{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/bafkreifyy4gdtstyjsfwev5j7kwzngfdgzkck3syiqlx2lenpvsblrvtia","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/bafkreifyy4gdtstyjsfwev5j7kwzngfdgzkck3syiqlx2lenpvsblrvtia","alt":"","ar":{"height":1440,"width":1080}},{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/bafkreig5hsh4vbl7tryb