{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/app.bsky.feed.post/3mrrpqysm6c2d","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2","uri":"at://did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/app.bsky.feed.post/3mrrpqysm6c2d","cid":"bafyreibj3hz774uo7xwua2rd3xrrpmfms3ztrkkys5sznvuxbucoswyuqe","auteur_did":"did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/hconwaymouret.bsky.social/post/3mrrpqysm6c2d","date":"2026-07-29T10:29:24.898Z","type":"original","indexe":"2026-07-29T10:29:32.670Z","text":"Faire de l’eau un véritable bien commun n’est pas une option. C’est une nécessité écologique, sociale et démocratique.\n\nSous l’effet du dérèglement climatique, la question de l’eau est devenue un véritable enjeu politique qui doit interroger notre capacité de développement.","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":null,"embed":{"images":[{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/bafkreihigdenznh3it7ruahv2eoikgqscotl2clhxkasxdl3wtltcutn4e","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/bafkreihigdenznh3it7ruahv2eoikgqscotl2clhxkasxdl3wtltcutn4e","alt":"","ar":{"height":1440,"width":1080}},{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/bafkreifbimizank4mfzftfdjcnip4fgdakzrerrquzvpwddmdzm6i2y4ce","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/bafkreifbimizank4mfzftfdjcnip4fgdakzrerrquzvpwddmdzm6i2y4ce","alt":"","ar":{"height":1440,"width":1080}},{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/bafkreib42m46pjq2fmaleampx5jnmnvufeeiuymu3fhd5rumdoq7i7dn3u","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/bafkreib42m46pjq2fmaleampx5jnmnvufeeiuymu3fhd5rumdoq7i7dn3u","alt":"","ar":{"height":1440,"width":1080}}]},"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/app.bsky.feed.post/3mrn6sp6zys2y","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2","uri":"at://did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/app.bsky.feed.post/3mrn6sp6zys2y","cid":"bafyreigxq43a4i7ibby5osdsjkesbflfryrym6dpqcuxx5dniophzovazy","auteur_did":"did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/hconwaymouret.bsky.social/post/3mrn6sp6zys2y","date":"2026-07-27T15:15:29.365Z","type":"original","indexe":"2026-07-27T15:15:34.392Z","text":"À l’académie militaire de Saint-Cyr Coëtquidan pour le transfert d’autorité entre le général Pierre Schill et son successeur Jacques Langlade de Montgros, en tant que chef d’état-major de l’armée de terre, devant les élèves officiers achevant leur scolarité.","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":null,"embed":{"images":[{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/bafkreifekjxdrx7d6f7otkvcqq7rpesapsvrrl6wr45lscbplgc7trs7wi","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/bafkreifekjxdrx7d6f7otkvcqq7rpesapsvrrl6wr45lscbplgc7trs7wi","alt":"","ar":{"height":1600,"width":1200}},{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/bafkreieaklw7gggsy5qxj4lx6qr3kxqe7zwhgl5xfru5u7p5oubnee5kwu","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/bafkreieaklw7gggsy5qxj4lx6qr3kxqe7zwhgl5xfru5u7p5oubnee5kwu","alt":"","ar":{"height":1600,"width":1200}},{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/bafkreibrwbibkwvsw7kjigjusotuya32ttc5awtcjiixeotnmndezf2m5m","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/bafkreibrwbibkwvsw7kjigjusotuya32ttc5awtcjiixeotnmndezf2m5m","alt":"","ar":{"height":1200,"width":1600}}]},"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/app.bsky.feed.post/3mrfvxkex6c2x","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2","uri":"at://did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/app.bsky.feed.post/3mrfvxkex6c2x","cid":"bafyreiaygr63mrwo7qkzyuim3smvmbajgfsmsl6thlwlis5umdvnewdk4y","auteur_did":"did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/hconwaymouret.bsky.social/post/3mrfvxkex6c2x","date":"2026-07-24T17:48:30.246Z","type":"original","indexe":"2026-07-24T17:48:30.562Z","text":"Face aux incendies dramatiques qui ravagent la Gironde et les Landes, j’exprime toute ma solidarité aux habitants évacués et mon plein soutien aux forces de la sécurité civile, à pied d’œuvre pour lutter contre les flammes et mettre les populations en sécurité.","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":null,"embed":null,"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/app.bsky.feed.post/3mrfc67tqm22r","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2","uri":"at://did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/app.bsky.feed.post/3mrfc67tqm22r","cid":"bafyreice5keh53m2tuyj6ci27p36fkuqh76x2sc5k3jn74y6srffvkghte","auteur_did":"did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/hconwaymouret.bsky.social/post/3mrfc67tqm22r","date":"2026-07-24T11:54:19.237Z","type":"original","indexe":"2026-07-24T11:54:26.534Z","text":"✍🏼 Mon billet d’humeur suite à l’adoption de la loi d’urgence agricole 🌾\n\nRéintroduire des pesticides interdits revient à traiter les symptômes plutôt que la maladie.\n\nL’urgence agricole est bien réelle. Celle démocratique et écologique l’est tout autant 🧶","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":null,"embed":null,"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:rp:did:plc:2aqxwjb7sjjsrxvumkarj75k:at://did:plc:fcmnegsmqe5eobqbyidqueng/app.bsky.feed.post/3mr7s65t2cs2l","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:2aqxwjb7sjjsrxvumkarj75k","uri":"at://did:plc:fcmnegsmqe5eobqbyidqueng/app.bsky.feed.post/3mr7s65t2cs2l","cid":"bafyreicrxfxyd476lln3ae4sxzw3komhaye5w6rutifhuonidqfrcfdewu","auteur_did":"did:plc:fcmnegsmqe5eobqbyidqueng","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/ecologistesenat.bsky.social/post/3mr7s65t2cs2l","date":"2026-07-24T09:39:29.476Z","type":"repost","indexe":"2026-07-24T09:39:29.476Z","text":"Pourquoi la réintroduction des pesticides tel qu’inscrit dans le projet de loi dit « d’urgence agricole » pose problème ?\n\nExplications de @melanievogel.bsky.social sur acetamipride \n\n#agricole #acetamipride #pesticides #agriculture","facets":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet","features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention","did":"did:plc:2aqxwjb7sjjsrxvumkarj75k"}],"index":{"byteEnd":174,"byteStart":149}},{"features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag","tag":"agricole"}],"index":{"byteEnd":203,"byteStart":194}},{"features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag","tag":"acetamipride"}],"index":{"byteEnd":217,"byteStart":204}},{"features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag","tag":"pesticides"}],"index":{"byteEnd":229,"byteStart":218}},{"features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag","tag":"agriculture"}],"index":{"byteEnd":242,"byteStart":230}}],"author":{"name":"Les Écologistes au Sénat","handle":"ecologistesenat.bsky.social","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/ecologistesenat.bsky.social"},"replyTo":null,"embed":{"video":{"thumb":"https://video.bsky.app/watch/did%3Aplc%3Afcmnegsmqe5eobqbyidqueng/bafkreidc6xy5t4riwhxrheenahw73lgn4cqva4nh6otfigalepzmtxmmce/thumbnail.jpg","alt":""}},"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/app.bsky.feed.post/3mraq2mdtek2y","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2","uri":"at://did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/app.bsky.feed.post/3mraq2mdtek2y","cid":"bafyreihosymbtgxn6wn3lzdpsxxxsyagivslp2t7mf7ekfspaa6ntoilvy","auteur_did":"did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/hconwaymouret.bsky.social/post/3mraq2mdtek2y","date":"2026-07-22T16:19:31.823Z","type":"original","indexe":"2026-07-22T16:19:39.075Z","text":"🚫📱 Ma réaction suite à l’adoption par le Parlement d’une loi interdisant l’usage des réseaux sociaux aux moins de 15 ans.\n\nJe soutiens cette mesure afin de reconnaître l’intérêt supérieur de l’enfant et placer la santé, l’éducation et l’émancipation de la jeunesse au cœur de notre projet de société.","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":null,"embed":{"images":[{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/bafkreifmqsbgcx2morfzgjvp4om6yqvht7u5xnciwz7fmvspxr2mlnj3gy","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/bafkreifmqsbgcx2morfzgjvp4om6yqvht7u5xnciwz7fmvspxr2mlnj3gy","alt":"","ar":{"height":1440,"width":1080}},{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/bafkreigfu3lds4em2gsh3sqdgompefcakgalicor5jex4qa7dju5gznyse","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/bafkreigfu3lds4em2gsh3sqdgompefcakgalicor5jex4qa7dju5gznyse","alt":"","ar":{"height":1440,"width":1080}},{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/bafkreifluwxvbuqlkemmczadpiixan7dhx7yvvlfibnhe3spnfg3vx3o2m","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/bafkreifluwxvbuqlkemmczadpiixan7dhx7yvvlfibnhe3spnfg3vx3o2m","alt":"","ar":{"height":1440,"width":1080}},{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:6i767zpi4oviretinbdg2wb2/bafkre